const bandLabels={junior:'初中词汇',senior:'高中词汇',cet4:'大学英语四级',cet6:'大学英语六级',ielts:'雅思词汇'};
function recommendedBand(){const age=state.user?.age||'18–24岁',level=state.user?.level||'B1';if(age==='12岁以下')return'junior';if(age==='13–17岁')return['A1','A2'].includes(level)?'junior':['B1','B2'].includes(level)?'senior':'ielts';if(['A1','A2'].includes(level))return'senior';if(level==='B1')return'cet4';if(level==='B2')return'cet6';return'ielts'}
function loadScript(src){return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const s=document.createElement('script');s.src=src;s.onload=resolve;s.onerror=reject;document.head.append(s)})}
async function loadDictionary(){if(window.WORD_DATABASE&&Object.keys(window.WORD_DATABASE).length>1000){dictionaryReady();return}try{if(['127.0.0.1','localhost'].includes(location.hostname))await loadScript('/word-dictionary/word-data.js');else await Promise.all(Array.from({length:40},(_,i)=>loadScript(`../dictionary/data/word-data-${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}.js`)));dictionaryReady()}catch{$('#dictionary-status').textContent='词库暂时未加载，请刷新页面重试。'}}
function dictionaryReady(){const count=Object.keys(window.WORD_DATABASE||{}).length;$('#dictionary-status').textContent=`完整词库已就绪 · ${count.toLocaleString()} 个词`}
function meaningsFor(entry){const raw=(entry?.meaning||'暂无释义').replace(/\r/g,'；');let list=raw.split(/[；;]/).flatMap(x=>x.split(/[,，](?=.{2,})/)).map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean);list=[...new Set(list)].slice(0,5);while(list.length<3)list.push(['常用语境中的相关表达','该词的延伸或搭配用法','结合上下文理解的补充含义'][list.length]||'补充含义');return list}
function wordExample(word,band){const templates={junior:`I learned how to use “${word}” in my English class today.`,senior:`The article gives a clear example of how “${word}” is used in context.`,cet4:`Students should understand “${word}” and use it accurately in communication.`,cet6:`The speaker used “${word}” to express a more precise and complex idea.`,ielts:`The essay uses “${word}” to develop a clear and well-supported argument.`};return templates[band||recommendedBand()]}
function renderDictionaryEntry(word,entry,band){const meanings=meaningsFor(entry);return`<div class="dictionary-result-head"><div><span>${entry?.level||bandLabels[band]||'英语词汇'}</span><h4>${word}</h4><p>${entry?.phonetic||'暂无音标'} · ${entry?.part||'英文单词'}</p></div><button class="audio-circle" data-dictionary-speak="${word}">◖</button></div><ol>${meanings.map(m=>`<li>${m}</li>`).join('')}</ol><blockquote>${wordExample(word,band)}</blockquote>`}
$('#dictionary-search-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const word=$('#dictionary-search-input').value.trim().toLowerCase(),entry=window.WORD_DATABASE?.[word];if(!entry){$('#dictionary-result').innerHTML=`<p class="dictionary-empty">没有找到 “${escapeHtml(word)}”，请检查拼写后再试。</p>`;return}$('#dictionary-result').innerHTML=renderDictionaryEntry(word,entry);$('[data-dictionary-speak]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>speak(word));sound('success')});
